; legacy.test, maintained in BIND and transferred by pdns-auth as a Slave zone.
; The NS record and the glue of ns must match nameservers and ttl of
; pdns_zone.legacy in infra/, or the next plan of infra/ shows a change.
; Increase the serial after a change and reload: docker compose exec bind rndc reload
$TTL 3600
@       IN SOA  ns.legacy.test. hostmaster.legacy.test. (
                2026112801 ; serial
                300        ; refresh
                60         ; retry
                86400      ; expire
                60 )       ; negative caching TTL
        IN NS   ns.legacy.test.
ns      IN A    10.53.0.30
www     IN A    192.0.2.20
@       IN TXT  "served by BIND, transferred by PowerDNS"
